# GaugeDesk

GaugeDesk is a desktop workbench for building and using AI agents on real
projects.

An agent combines instructions, tools, and limits for a specific type of work.
Add an agent to a project, choose the files it can use, and give it a task.
GaugeDesk shows you what the agent reads, does, and changes. The work stays
separate from your project until you review it and choose to keep it.

GaugeDesk blocks access that you did not allow and records the important actions
in each run. You connect your own model provider. That provider receives your
prompt and the files that you allow for the task.

[Download GaugeDesk](https://gaugewright.com/gaugedesk/download){ .md-button .md-button--primary }
